  "project_description": "Comment Admin Notify sends a plain-text notification e-mail to a configured administrator address every time a new comment is inserted, on the content types you select. Subject and body are token-aware templates (comment and node tokens) edited from a single settings form; the module also logs each notification to the watchdog log. It depends on core Comment and the contributed Token module.",
